tus": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777393186, "id": "25683810261295815", "version": "6.6.301", "version_code": 10771, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25680852858258222"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "395453121030677"}]}, "change_log": "General\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Re-enable laser pointer for viewers\n- Faster loading of HDR environments, removal of seam at the back of the environment\n- Added cloud syncing of user preferences across devices\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- When import quality options are available, default to High rather than Original to avoid performance issues\n- Voice chat audio is no longer on a delay when joining a room in Web Collab on Safari and waiting some time to interact with the app\n\nVR\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Can use smart move while grid is enabled\n- (standalone only) Faster loading of large images\n- Paint tool now highlights objects in its range, is more precise\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Environment dome is now properly lit, gives correct preview of the environment in use\n- Can now use colour saturation increments when a sketch tool with a central line is selected\n- When import quality options available, don\u2019t preview original quality before asking confirmation in performance impact popup\n- Wi-fi symbol above controller now accurately reflects connection issue status\n- Collab - fixed user becoming invisible and not uploading changes if they experience longer connection fluctuations\n- (Quest only) Transition between Touch controller and MX Ink pen no longer requires opening the Quest OS menu\n\nScreen App\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Ensure mic is muted by default on joining a room", "created_date": 1777372911, "id": "25680852858258222", "version": "6.6.300", "version_code": 10769, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}